{
  "id": "JOB.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this opened Job his mouth, and cursed his day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Job spake, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let the day perish wherein I was born, and the night",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it was said, There is a man child conceived.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let that day be darkness; let not God regard it from above, neither let the light shine upon it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let darkness and the shadow of death stain it; let a cloud dwell upon it; let the blackness of the day terrify it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that night, let darkness seize upon it; let it not be joined unto the days of the year, let it not come into the number of the months.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, let that night be solitary, let no joyful voice come therein.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them curse it that curse the day, who are ready to raise up their mourning.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let the stars of the twilight thereof be dark; let it look for light, but",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "have",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none; neither let it see the dawning of the day:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because it shut not up the doors of my",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "mother's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "womb, nor hid sorrow from mine eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why died I not from the womb?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "why",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "give up the ghost when I came out of the belly?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why did the knees prevent me? or why the breasts that I should suck?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For now should I have lain still and been quiet, I should have slept: then had I been at rest,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With kings and counsellors of the earth, which built desolate places for themselves;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or with princes that had gold, who filled their houses with silver:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or as an hidden untimely birth I had not been; as infants",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "never saw light.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There the wicked cease",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "troubling; and there the weary be at rest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the prisoners rest together; they hear not the voice of the oppressor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The small and great are there; and the servant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "free from his master.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore is light given to him that is in misery, and life unto the bitter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soul;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which long for death, but it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "cometh",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not; and dig for it more than for hid treasures;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which rejoice exceedingly,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are glad, when they can find the grave?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Why is light given",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.3.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.3.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to a man whose way is hid, and whom God hath hedged in?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
